# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:Demon Slayer" by tools/quests/transcript_to_dialogue.py
0	section	Starting off
1	line	Aris	Hello young one. Cross my palm with silver and the future will be revealed to you.
1	cond	If the player doesn't have any money with them:
2	line	Player	Oh dear. I don't have any money.
2	action	end
1	option	Yes.
2	line	Player	Okay, here you go.
2	line	Aris	Come closer, and listen carefully to what the future holds for you, as I peer into the swirling mists of the crystal ball.
2	line	Aris	I can see images forming. I can see you.
2	line	Aris	You are holding a very impressive looking sword. I'm sure I recognise that sword...
2	line	Aris	There is a big dark shadow appearing now.
2	line	Aris	Aaargh!
2	line	Player	Are you all right?
2	line	Aris	It's Delrith! Delrith is coming!
2	line	Player	Who's Delrith?
2	line	Aris	Delrith...
2	line	Aris	Delrith is a powerful demon.
2	line	Aris	Oh! I really hope he didn't see me looking at him through my crystal ball!
2	line	Aris	He tried to destroy this city 150 years ago. He was stopped just in time by the great hero Wally.
2	line	Aris	Using his magic sword Silverlight, Wally managed to trap the demon in the stone circle just south of this city.
2	line	Aris	Ye gods! Silverlight was the sword you were holding in my vision! You are the one destined to stop the demon this time.
2	select	What would you like to say?
2	option	How am I meant to fight a demon who can destroy cities?
3	line	Player	How am I meant to fight a demon who can destroy cities?!
3	line	Aris	If you face Delrith while he is still weak from being summoned, and use the correct weapon, you will not find the task too arduous.
3	line	Aris	Do not fear. If you follow the path of the great hero Wally, then you are sure to defeat the demon.
3	action	other
2	option	Okay, where is he? I'll kill him for you!
3	line	Player	Okay, where is he? I'll kill him for you!
3	line	Aris	Ah, the overconfidence of the young!
3	line	Aris	Delrith can't be harmed by ordinary weapons. You must face him using the same weapon that Wally used.
3	action	other
2	option	Wally doesn't sound like a very heroic name.
3	line	Player	Wally doesn't sound a very heroic name.
3	line	Aris	Yes I know. Maybe that is why history doesn't remember him. However he was a very great hero.
3	line	Aris	Who knows how much pain and suffering Delrith would have brought forth without Wally to stop him!
3	line	Aris	It looks like you are going to need to perform similar heroics.
3	action	other
2	option	So how did Wally kill Delrith?
3	line	Player	So how did Wally kill Delrith?
3	line	Aris	Wally managed to arrive at the stone circle just as Delrith was summoned by a cult of chaos druids...
3	line	Wally	Die, foul demon!
3	line	Wally	Now, what was that incantation again?
3	action	The following five words are Aber, Gabindo, Purchai, Camerinthum, and Carlem. The order of the five words is random.
3	line	Wally	[word 1]... [word 2]... [word 3]... [word 4]... [word 5]!
3	line	Wally	I am the greatest demon slayer EVER!
3	line	Aris	By reciting the correct magical incantation, and thrusting Silverlight into Delrith while he was newly summoned, Wally was able to imprison Delrith in the stone block in the centre of the circle.
3	line	Aris	Delrith will come forth from the stone circle again.
3	line	Aris	I would imagine an evil sorcerer is already starting on the rituals to summon Delrith as we speak.
3	option	How am I meant to fight a demon who can destroy cities?
4	action	above
3	option	Okay, where is he? I'll kill him for you!
4	action	above
3	option	What is the magical incantation?
4	line	Player	What is the magical incantation?
4	line	Aris	Oh yes, let me think a second...
4	action	The following five words Aber, Gabindo, Purchai, Camerinthum, and Carlem
4	line	Aris	Alright, I think I've got it now, it goes.... [word 1]... [word 2]... [word 3]... [word 4]... [word 5]. Have you got that?
4	line	Player	I think so, yes.
4	action	other
3	option	Where can I find Silverlight?
4	line	Player	Where can I find Silverlight?
4	line	Aris	Silverlight has been passed down through Wally's descendants. I believe it is currently in the care of one of the King's knights called Sir Prysin.
4	line	Aris	He shouldn't be too hard to find. He lives in the royal palace in this city. Tell him Aris sent you.
4	action	other
3	option	Okay, thanks. I'll do my best to stop the demon.
4	line	Player	Ok thanks. I'll do my best to stop the demon.
4	line	Aris	Good luck, and may Guthix be with you!
4	action	Demon Slayer is started.
4	action	end
