7	line	Captain Rovin	I got one key and I think some wizard got another. Now what happened to the third one?
7	line	Player	Sir Prysin dropped it down a drain!
7	line	Captain Rovin	Ha ha ha! The idiot!
7	line	Captain Rovin	Okay, I'll give you the key, just so that it's you that kills the demon and not Sir Prysin!
